 # Implement Tattler pending inbox state and dedupe
 
 Add a Tattler-owned pending inbox for inbound messages received while an agent is busy. The inbox is the source of truth outside Pi's steer/follow-up queues, preserves arrival order, dedupes by message id (and room/post id for Chorus), and can emit an extension-private appendEntry audit/snapshot for recovery before flush. Do not enqueue real inbound payloads into Pi while busy.
 
